    'az.help': 'Broadcom VCF 9.1 table: ESXi Management, vMotion, vSAN and NSX Host Overlay have one network per AZ (routed between AZs), VM Management is stretched. A per-AZ network may reuse the same VLAN ID but needs a distinct subnet; a stretched network keeps the same VLAN ID and subnet on both AZs. <a href="https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vcf/vcf-9-0-and-later/9-1/design/design-library/storage-models-9-x/standard-vsan-storage-model/stretched-cluster-storage-models/vsan-stretched-cluster-network-requirements.html" target="_blank" style="color:#1e6abf">TechDocs source</a>',
